          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**GIMP Native** adds an iPad Home Screen launcher and individual xiOS host window for the full `gimp` package.\n\nGIMP still runs locally as the same arm64 GTK3 build; this package supplies the iPadOS-facing launcher and host integration. It requires a compatible rootless jailbreak and installs the main GIMP package as a dependency.\n\n[More screenshots and port details](https://xios.maxleiter.com/apps/gimp)"
